          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Use Guide",
            "text": "<p>For magic and grounding, apply 2-4 drops right when you wake up to greet the sun!&nbsp;<br/>If you wash your face in the am, massage 2–4 drops onto face and neck after cleansing and <a href=\"https://yayforearth.com/products/hydrosol-spritzie\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Hydrosol Spritzie\">toning or misting</a>. Apply before sunscreen, or layer under our <a href=\"/products/1oz-sensitive-skin-face-lotion\" title=\"Sensitive Skin Face Lotion\">YFE Sensitive Skin Face Lotion</a> for added hydration.</p>"
          }
        },
        "eae1604e-fd60-4298-a478-0e6cb85acd78": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients",
            "text": "<p>Organic Rosa Canina Seed Oil (<strong>Rosehip</strong>), Organic Sclerocarya Birrea Seed Oil (<strong>Marula</strong>), Organic Mauritia Flexuosa Fruit Oil (<strong>Buriti</strong>), Organic Camellia Japonica Seed Oil (<strong>Camellia</strong>), Organic Opuntia Ficus-Indica Seed Oil (<strong>Prickly Pear</strong>), Organic Simmondsia Chinensis Seed Oil (<strong>Jojoba</strong>), Organic Hippophae Rhamnoides Fruit Oil (<strong>Sea Buckthorn Oil</strong>)</p>"
          }
        },
        "42ce5b98-e943-4d2b-ab57-191f26170632": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sourcing",
            "text": "<p>Our Sunny Drops oil serum is crafted with seven intentionally sourced oils, each chosen for its purity and purpose.&nbsp;<br/>Rosehip and Jojoba are responsibly grown and harvested by a Fair for Life certified facility committed to zero waste and climate neutrality.&nbsp;<br/>Marula oil is Fair Trade certified and sourced directly from a women's co-op in Zimbabwe, supporting local farmers and communities. Buriti is ethically wild-harvested from the biodiverse Amazon rainforest with full traceability and community partnerships that protect the ecosystem.&nbsp;<br/>Camellia, Sea Buckthorn, and Prickly Pear are all COSMOS Organic certified, cold-pressed, and unrefined to preserve their potency. We will never compromise when it comes to sourcing our ingredients; period. To read more about our ethos and farmers, <a href=\"https://yayforearth.com/pages/meet-the-farmers\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://yayforearth.com/pages/meet-the-farmers\">click here</a>!</p>"
          }
